==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
Originally the dative of {{m|non||*hjá|t=household}} (from {{inh|non|gem-pro|*hīwô}}), thus literally "at home"; compare {{m|non|hjú}}, {{m|non|hjó}}, {{m|non|hjón}}.

